. We had a thing going on about Norman Granz's Jazz at the Philharmonic. Mickey Roker and I were the two drummers. We wound up playing fours. He made me stand up and take notice. Yes he did. Had the right attitude. Nice man. We had fun together.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11726$6F6B0C22-0215-4712-90CB-26ABB9D448B8", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "209acd5544fc87af9fa1d813474c5c08d2597d5d", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8c3ff6578b7b25fa86a7c9d7a9053d1b/930.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11726$27CF03ED-5AD9-422E-85BF-0C69DF208242", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "37c56fb9c2fa46e9304203ae27aa453b24e62ce6", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 134, "id": "Q134"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11726$53849B41-03D4-4054-AC17-DB59E58CB051", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "a3af9a70d3f1367aee6594e6706aa624535d98fa", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1154, "id": "Q1154"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11726$06B87710-395C-4130-A41A-3E8C2F0DDFB7", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "0e5ce292df993d79dcf01467e0e5a2c8509775e9", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11726$52BE3474-76BE-4B2E-9165-616C1915869D", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "6728b1d69fb03de3e91c83a040b2b8876a0c8810", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"},